90	    ///
91	    /// # Example
92	    ///
93	    /// If we have a max idle per hosts set to 3, and we have the following LRU:
94	    ///
95	    /// ```text
96	    /// [B, A, A, B, A, B, A]
97	    /// ```
98	    ///
99	    /// This field is used to enumerate the elements per host reverse:
100	    ///
101	    /// ```text
102	    /// [B2, A3, A2, B1, A1, B0, A0]
103	    /// ```
104	    ///
